  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1401.12 Bungee jumping",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.12 “Bungee jumping” means the act of a person jumping or falling from a stationary structure while tethered to the structure with a bungee cord.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400) #5607 eff 4-2-93, EXPIRED: 4-2-99\n\nNew. #7000, eff 5-25-99 EXPIRED: 5-25-07\n\nNew. #8964, INTERIM, eff 8-20-07; ss by #9079, eff 1-28-08; ss by #11151, eff 8-11-16; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.08) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
